{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39314","headline":"癸丑年下第献新先辈 · 韦庄","name":"癸丑年下第献新先辈","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"五更残月省墙边，绦斾蜺旌卓晓烟。\n千炬火中莺出谷，一声钟後鹤冲天。\n皆乘骏马先归去，独被羸童笑晚眠。\n对酒暂时情豁尔，见花依旧涕潸然。\n未酬阚泽佣书债，犹欠君平卖卜钱。\n何事欲休休不得，来年公道似今年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦庄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39314.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39314","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}